Every pill-shaped text control downgrades to rounded-lg: the Segmented track
and its tabs + sliding marker, the Matches league chips, show-all, and
empty-day jump, the Table Tables/Browse switch and empty action, Cups back,
Onboarding skip/back rows, Profile dismiss, the timeline comment pulls,
PickerTabs and the LineupPicker side toggle, and the ErrorState retry.
Circles stay circles: icon buttons (TopBar/Matches/BottomSheet/team badges),
avatars and dots, progress-bar caps, skeleton circles, and the switch track
(a switch stops being a switch at rounded-lg). Chips were already rounded-md.

